<title>USA: Roosevelt gets acquisition approval.</title>
<headline>Roosevelt gets acquisition approval.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelt Financial Group Inc said Thursday it received the necessary approvals to complete three previously announced acquisitions.</p>
<p>Roosevelt had been awaiting approval from the Office of Thrift Supervision, the Federal Reserve and the Missouri Division of Finance.</p>
<p>Roosevelt said it is acquiring Mutual Bancompany Inc, the holding company for Mutual Savings Bank FSB of Jefferson City; Sentinel Financial Corp ; and Community Charter Corp, including its subsidiary Missouri State Bank.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
